{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413060","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1041306001:1":{"text":"Master Arden, how did you know that following the butterflies would lead to Ivoryshade?","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，你怎么知道跟着蝴蝶就能找到月影乡呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4249CAEFBA350CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041306002:1":{"text":"Even for Wilders, Ivoryshade is a special place. It's a paradise blessed by Misarte herself.","source_cn":"呵呵呵……放心吧。即使对绿裔成员来说，月影乡也是个足够...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F2864BE78D2180D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041306003:1":{"text":"\"If you are pure of heart and favored by the gods, then come and go as you please. If evil lies in your heart, pass through the forest and be confined with ease.\"","source_cn":"“你心存善念，得神眷顾，即可随意往来；你心怀歹意，寻遍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BF6329CDF7CB15C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041306004:1":{"text":"W-What did you say...?","source_cn":"呃……眷顾……囿、囿于……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7803B7CD4AA0367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041306005:1":{"text":"What does that even mean?","source_cn":"这句话是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F6CBB3BE3217D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1041306005":{"text":"What does that even mean?","source_cn":"这句话是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F6CBB3BE3217D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041306006:1":{"text":"Both you and Master Arden are so deep and smart!","source_cn":"唔……雅顿贤者和主人的话，都太深奥了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3AB8E6F42358C9B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Both you and Master Arden are so deep and smart!","female":"Both you and Master Arden are so deep and smart!","variant_male_record_index":"112330","variant_female_record_index":"112331","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041306007:1":{"text":"Windwhisperers sure are strange.","source_cn":"风语者，真是千奇百怪呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x939CAF6612CC97A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1041306007":{"text":"Windwhisperers sure are strange.","source_cn":"风语者，真是千奇百怪呀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x939CAF6612CC97A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041306008:1":{"text":"Take L